   281	  telemetry); Turnstile day-one vs adaptive; init raw-key vs
   282	  device-token; `BOT_SCORE_MIN`; free-tier quota/viewport shape.
   283	- Standing exclusions unaffected: the public Tribunal repo never names
   284	  WhipNode; the recipe page lives on whipnode.com and teaches
   285	  orchestrator-captures/seats-receive.

